      "writtenOn": "2024-12-04T17:48:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The atomic set here is correctly identifying that the event has occurred. The ones in `tps_notify_new_power_contract` are really a timeout indicator to prevent the functions from looping. I couldn\u0027t think of a simpler way to do it even though it looks redundant",
